  "$Comment": "Mob Battle training spear fighter's combat with the player's own iron spear attacks (the older weapon set: no signature energy). Basic = Spear_Attack tapped (Spear_Stab). The held attack (Spear_Throw_Charged) is left out: it throws the spear and takes it out of the hand (ModifyInventory AdjustHeldItemQuantity -1, no game-mode check), so the dummy would end up unarmed. Guard = Spear_Block after taking damage. Every action carries Weapon_Spear_Iron's interaction vars. Basic attack = Spear_Stab directly: the player's Spear_Attack is a Charging with AllowIndefiniteHold, and an NPC never releases it (the dummy stood charging and never attacked). Kept distances: the role's MaintainDistance takes its range from each action's PostExecuteDistanceRange, so they all stay inside the basic attack's reach (strafe 2.5-4 kept it out of reach, staring at its rival); basic attack Timeout 0.5 lets it finish aiming instead of losing the try and waiting a cooldown.",
